---
// Expert.astro
---

<section class="expert">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="expert-inner">
      <div class="expert-left">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Why trust us</span>
        <h2 class="expert-headline reveal reveal-delay-1">
          You're not hiring<br/> an agency.
          <span class="serif">You're hiring an expert.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="expert-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
          Most agencies take your money and hand your account to whoever's free that week. Someone still figuring out what a GBP is, running your business like a practice exercise.
        </p>
        <p class="expert-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <strong>SupraReach doesn't work that way.</strong> Every strategy, every build, every optimization is done by the same person who built the system — someone who has spent years learning exactly how Google ranks local businesses, tested across restaurants, contractors, retail, insurance, and more.
        </p>
        <p class="expert-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
          We know what moves the needle because we've moved it. In real Texas markets. For real businesses.
        </p>
        <div class="expert-creds reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="cred"><span class="cred-dot"></span><div><strong>Local SEO</strong><span>Google Maps specialist</span></div></div>
          <div class="cred"><span class="cred-dot"></span><div><strong>Web Design</strong><span>Conversion-first builds</span></div></div>
          <div class="cred"><span class="cred-dot"></span><div><strong>Social Media</strong><span>Authority-driven content</span></div></div>
          <div class="cred"><span class="cred-dot"></span><div><strong>Texas-Based</strong><span>Built for local markets</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="expert-right reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="expert-quote">
          <blockquote>
            "Google Maps is the most valuable real estate a local business can own. It's the first thing customers see. Most businesses abandon it and then wonder why their phones aren't ringing."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="quote-sig">
            <div class="quote-avatar">G</div>
            <div>
              <div class="quote-name">Gio</div>
              <div class="quote-role">Founder, SupraReach Marketing</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="expert-deco"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
